  text p
  text ><
  text i
  text >
  text <
  text p
  text ><
  text i
  text >
  text <
  text p
  text ><
  text i
  text >
  text <
  text p
  text ><
  text i
  text >
text The resulting DOM for this fragment would be:
link p grouping-content.html#the-p-element
link i text-level-semantics.html#the-i-element
