text Errors that indicate a likely misunderstanding of the specification
text Sometimes, something is disallowed because allowing it would likely cause author confusion.
text "For example, setting the  attribute to the value \"\" is disallowed, because despite the appearance of meaning that the element is enabled, it in fact means that the element is  (what matters for implementations is the presence of the attribute, not its value)."
